# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Trust anchors for session signing certificates: one SSH CA public key per
# line (as printed by `ssh-keygen -y` or the CA's .pub file). Each becomes
#   <CLAUDE_SIGNING_EMAIL> cert-authority,namespaces="git" <key>
# in the session's allowed_signers. Empty until the owner's key ceremony
# (docs/practice/session-signing-certificates.adoc): list the TPM CA and the
# offline recovery CA from day one. Remove a stolen CA's line outright; do not
# rely on valid-before (see the proposal, "Revocation after theft").
